starterCode:
fun permissionsToRequest(required: List<String>, granted: Set<String>): List<String> {
    return required.filter { it in granted }
}

solution:
fun permissionsToRequest(required: List<String>, granted: Set<String>): List<String> {
    return required.filter { it !in granted }
}

